{
  "title": "Tutorial Virginia Player",
  "description": "Veja como configurar o Virginia Player em sua Smart TV.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-info-circle'></i> Sobre o Virginia Player</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O Virginia Player é uma opção elegante e rápida para Smart TVs. Exige o envio da lista pelo site oficial.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Pegue seus IDs</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-4'>Abra o app na TV e anote os códigos <b>MAC Address</b> e <b>Device Key</b> que aparecem na tela de início.</p></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Configure no Site</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-6'>Acesse o portal oficial do Virginia Player para vincular sua lista.</p><a href='https://virginiaplayer.com/login' target='_blank' class='inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-black py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl transition-all shadow-xl uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest mb-8'><i class='fas fa-external-link-alt'></i> Abrir Site Virginia Player</a><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-xs mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest'>No site:</p><ul class='space-y-3'><li class='flex items-start gap-3'><i class='fas fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1'></i><p class='text-gray-400 text-[10px]'>Faça o login com seu <b>MAC</b> e <b>Key</b>.</p></li><li class='flex items-start gap-3'><i class='fas fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1'></i><p class='text-gray-400 text-[10px]'>Adicione sua playlist colando o link <b>M3U Plus</b>.</p></li><li class='flex items-start gap-3'><i class='fas fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1'></i><p class='text-gray-400 text-[10px]'>Clique em <b>Save</b>.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Atualize sua TV</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-4'>Reinicie o Virginia Player na sua TV para começar a assistir.</p></section></div>"
  }
}